  "notes": "STATION.md 8b: the night is outside. A site has a number of searches a visit; each search draws one entry from its loot table (by weight w, n of it) and the finds are revealed for you to take or leave. Sites refill every night. You have two body slots, the pack and one tool: a gated site is locked without its tool in the slot, and a bonus tool adds searches at an open site. A night is one outing (stops_per_night places, no energy: it is after hours), finds come home in the pack, tools wear a use a visit (a refill is used up). Shops are counters where you are the customer: a daily restock, and a floor price for what they buy. The Company Store is the Wire's store.company: no trip, freight the next morning. Every number is a starting guess for scripts/station-sim.ts.",
